<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CarMax rated strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CarMax rated strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of CarMax Group with a strong buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares slipped 1/8 to 20 in early trade Monday.</p>
</text>
